They have 4 Qlogic SCSI adapters and a Mylex DAC960 bundled with the server
for a disk shelf configured for RAID-5.

 

I read that FreeBSD can boot from a raid volume on these controllers but
I?ve been trying to install FreeBSD since 4.8 on these servers without no
success.

 

I can boot the install cd, it finds the mylex, shows the raid volume but
when I start the installation to create a slice, it says that no disks where
found on the system.

 

On this list, there is anyone with a similar server and installed FreeBSD
with success??? I don?t want to put a system disk on a Qlogic controller
just to boot and I really want to use the raid volume from the Mylex.

 

Can anyone help me on this issue??? I can also make any tests for the
community on these machines.

 

 

Thanks in advance,

 

 

Alessandro.

